name: Cavendish — X3 mult after extinction
author: corpus
description: >-
  Cavendish gives X3 Mult, with a 1 in 1000 chance to be destroyed at end of round.
  Only spawns after Gros Michel goes extinct. Find the Ante 1 extinction event then grab
  Cavendish in the Ante 2 shop.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - grosMichelExtinct: [1]
  - joker: Cavendish
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Brainstorm
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
